{"id": "70004", "title": "流年·爱（网名：美人桥）", "author": "靡宝", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 10, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70004.htm", "intro": "关于桥，有一个美丽传说。丑姑娘若是在桥上祈祷，天上的神便会把她变得漂亮。胖姑娘情场失意，果真于桥下捞起了俊秀少年。真正的缘分，是经得起时间的考验，经得起风波坎坷，经得起岁月变迁。林天行说：人生就是一场宏大的rpg。那么，谁能陪谁走到最后，笑傲江湖？", "base": "files/article/html/70/70004", "chapters": [{"title": "章节目录", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10769282.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10769283.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10769284.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10769285.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10769286.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10769287.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10769288.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10769289.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10769290.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10769291.html", "available": false}]}